{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Knight Variant\u00a0</strong>is a thoughtful, challenging single-player 2D puzzle game inspired by the unique movement of the knight in chess. Your task is simple in concept but complex in execution: place a knight on the board and move it according to standard chess rules, aiming to visit as many squares as possible before you run out of moves or legal options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session challenges your planning and foresight \u2014 can you outthink the board and cover every square? With four difficulty modes adjusting the number of moves available, you'll find a level for every player, whether you're a casual puzzler or a seasoned chess strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Strategic Challenge:</strong> Move the knight across an 8x8 board, maximizing the number of visited squares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u265f\ufe0f <strong>Multiple Difficulties:</strong> Four modes to test your planning and adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements based on how far you travel, your final position, and how many squares you conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Plan Ahead:</strong> Use Shift + Click to plan future moves and craft your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Inspiration from Chess Lore:</strong> Reflecting the famous idea that while the King moves slowly and surely, the Knight demands cunning and foresight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the beauty and complexity of knight movement in chess, FourthKnight Variation offers a fresh twist for chess lovers, puzzle fans, and strategy gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find out if you are a King \u2014 steady and unstoppable \u2014 or a true Knight \u2014 clever, daring, and relentless?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unveiling Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/41080500a7bacaa47683ecae92476d50e9802979.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/342d052a127a4a8aaf0a4dd127d0435f8840d66c.jpg"},{"name":"True Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/a12dbf6a5e93dc129856ebb450b1e3ad0d6f74e8.jpg"},{"name":"The Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/543832d5e50ac3cdf6ae66130c63a3f1d7800565.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/48c0f2708e3b216632a0a059befab54b74cbf6da.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Precision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/dd6595d8d82e24fd04cc71df4078de7b2c502054.jpg"},{"name":"Tactical Navigator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/bca07f171572e7cdf9de4a4c5c1db71493fc0e66.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/69a4ad63795bdb12dedd71f0cd062f13b840a21c.jpg"},{"name":"Pathfinder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/b96d155bbb5d602f1e1a1ca7736abd8f8443e6af.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Striker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784500/10f64056f732cd002155008f0ba28b0c332641e7.jpg"}],"total":69},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2784500?t=1760982912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2784500?t=1760982912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784500/82865c2533b092740879afa778d445