oves and craft your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Inspiration from Chess Lore:</strong> Reflecting the famous idea that while the King moves slowly and surely, the Knight demands cunning and foresight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the beauty and complexity of knight movement in chess, FourthKnight Variation offers a fresh twist for chess lovers, puzzle fans, and strategy gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find out if you are a King \u2014 steady and unstoppable \u2014 or a true Knight \u2014 clever, daring, and relentless?</p>","developers":["WhimSoul Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784500/621ad4b64c42291b4b4f305ceb53a3f38f8ff5ca/header.jpg?t=1760982912","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2784500/1029875702/4935f8d9f6ca025576d488c8ec74f39a13f5a790/1752777419/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754824252","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2784500/1029875702/4935f8d9f6ca025576d488c8ec74f39a13f5a790/1752777419/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754824252","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2784500/1029875702/4935f8d9f6ca025576d488c8ec74f39a13f5a790/1752777419/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754824252","id":257170418,"name":"GameTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170418/dbd6b477e00ced2e86edf514e26d06076b13a2f1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754824252"}],"name":"FourKnightVariant","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_tex